@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+## Context
+
+Each bug is a one-line deviation from the README rules.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- `Catalog.find` uses `canonicalSku` instead of `trim()`; all other catalogue methods go through `find`.
+- `shippingCost` uses `goods >= FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS`.
+- `lineVat` uses `percentOf` (the half-up helper already used for shipping VAT) instead of `Math.floor`.
+
+## Risks
+
+Existing orders are unaffected; only newly priced orders change. Inventory methods take SKUs already canonicalised by the catalogue, so they are left alone.
