+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Three reports show the code disagreeing with the README business rules: lower-case SKUs are refused as unknown, a basket of exactly €50.00 is charged shipping, and line VAT is one cent short on some lines.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- SKU lookup in the catalogue uses the canonical form (trimmed and upper-cased), so `lb-220` finds `LB-220`.
+- Free shipping applies when goods after every discount, before VAT, are €50.00 **or more** (currently only above).
+- Line VAT is rounded half up to the cent instead of rounded down.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `product-catalog`: SKU identity is case-insensitive and ignores surrounding spaces.
+- `shipping`: free-shipping threshold is inclusive.
+- `vat`: line VAT rounds half up to the cent.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/catalog.ts` (`find`), `src/shipping.ts` (`shippingCost`), `src/tax.ts` (`lineVat`); tests under `test/`. No API changes.
